---
import {
  claimState,
  h138Metrics,
  nextDecisionNodes,
  openEvoProgramLinks,
  openEvoProgramSource,
  programResultLabels,
  programStageLabels,
  programTimeline,
  type ProgramLocale,
} from '../../data/openEvoWebShopProgram';

interface Props { locale?: ProgramLocale }
const { locale = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (zh: string, en: string) => isZh ? zh : en;
const f = new Intl.NumberFormat(locale === 'zh' ? 'zh-CN' : 'en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 6 });
const plotMin = -0.1;
const plotMax = 0.15;
const plotLeft = 116;
const plotWidth = 390;
const plotX = (value: number) => plotLeft + ((value - plotMin) / (plotMax - plotMin)) * plotWidth;
const plotRows = h138Metrics.filter((metric) => metric.ci !== null);
const hasHistoricalAppendix = Astro.slots.has('historical');
---

<article class="paper-report" data-program-report data-ui-audit="contrast layout overflow" data-testid="openevo-webshop-program-report">
  <header class="paper-header" id="abstract">
    <p class="kicker">OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · H1.38A-C · {openEvoProgramSource.checkedAt}</p>
    <h2>{t('实验结论', 'Experimental conclusion')}</h2>
    <p class="abstract"><strong>{t(
      '固定 16 条成功记录后，提高训练 task identity 多样性没有产生单调收益。',
      'With 16 successful records fixed, greater training task-identity diversity did not produce a monotonic benefit.'
    )}</strong> {t(
      'task identity 指一个具体 WebShop 任务实例；D4、D8、D16 分别使用来自 4、8、16 个训练任务实例的记录。D16 的观测均值最高，但 D4、D8、D16 相对 Base 的 task-cluster 95% CI 全部跨 0，因此没有建立可靠正向迁移，也不能把 task-identity diversity 写成单调解释。',
      'A task identity is one specific WebShop task instance; D4, D8, and D16 draw their records from 4, 8, or 16 training task instances. D16 has the highest observed mean, but every task-cluster 95% CI versus Base crosses zero, so the panel establishes neither reliable positive transfer nor a monotonic task-identity-diversity explanation.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="implication">{t(
      '实践含义：下一轮应先在同一份 H1.38 D8 数据上比较 ordinary sequential LoRA 与现有 SD-LoRA，再决定是否修改经验 schema 或信用分配。',
      'Practical implication: the next run should first compare ordinary sequential LoRA with the current SD-LoRA on the same H1.38 D8 data, before changing the experience schema or credit assignment.'
    )}</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('报告目录', 'Report contents')}>
    <a href="#results">{t('结果', 'Results')}</a>
    <a href="#interpretation">{t('解释', 'Interpretation')}</a>
    <a href="#next-experiment">{t('下一实验', 'Next experiment')}</a>
    <a href="#methods">{t('方法与来源', 'Methods & sources')}</a>
    <a href="#appendix">{t('附录', 'Appendix')}</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="paper-section" id="results" aria-labelledby="results-title">
    <p class="section-number">01</p>
    <h2 id="results-title">{t('主要结果', 'Primary result')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t(
      '表格是主证据。四个实验臂各有 192 次尝试；D4 的 4 次 parser/fallback-invalid 尝试被保留审计，但不进入科学分母。',
      'The table is the authoritative evidence. Each arm has 192 attempts; four parser/fallback-invalid D4 attempts remain auditable but stay outside the scientific denominator.'
    )}</p>

    <div class="table-region" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t('H1.38A-C 主结果表，可横向滚动', 'H1.38A-C primary result table, horizontally scrollable')}>
      <table>
        <caption>{t('H1.38A-C 冻结面板：Base、D4、D8、D16', 'H1.38A-C frozen panel: Base, D4, D8, and D16')}</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">{t('实验臂', 'Arm')}</th><th scope="col">{t('有效/尝试', 'Valid/attempts')}</th><th scope="col">{t('平均分', 'Mean score')}</th><th scope="col">{t('相对 Base 配对差异', 'Paired delta vs Base')}</th><th scope="col">95% CI</th><th scope="col">p</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{h138Metrics.map((metric) => <tr><th scope="row">{metric.label}</th><td>{metric.valid}/{metric.attempts}</td><td>{f.format(metric.mean)}</td><td>{metric.delta === null ? '—' : `${metric.delta >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${f.format(metric.delta)}`}</td><td>{metric.ci === null ? '—' : `[${f.format(metric.ci[0])}, ${f.format(metric.ci[1])}]`}</td><td>{metric.p === null ? '—' : metric.p}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="validity-note"><strong>764 / 768 {t('科学有效', 'scientifically valid')}.</strong> {t(
      '4 次无效尝试全部来自 D4，原因是动作解析失败后触发 fallback（预定义替代动作）；无效尝试不支持效果解释。',
      'All four invalid attempts are in D4 and followed action-parsing failures that triggered a fallback (a predefined substitute action); invalid attempts support no efficacy interpretation.'
    )}</p>

    <figure class="ci-figure" aria-labelledby="ci-title ci-caption">
      <div class="figure-heading"><h3 id="ci-title">{t('相对 Base 的配对差异', 'Paired differences versus Base')}</h3><p>{t('点为配对差异，横线为 task-cluster 95% CI；竖线表示零差异。', 'Points are paired differences, horizontal lines are task-cluster 95% CIs, and the vertical line marks zero difference.')}</p></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 230" role="img" aria-label={t('D4、D8、D16 的差异与置信区间均跨零', 'D4, D8, and D16 differences and confidence intervals, all crossing zero')}>
        <line class="axis" x1={plotLeft} y1="194" x2={plotLeft + plotWidth} y2="194" />
        <line class="zero" x1={plotX(0)} y1="28" x2={plotX(0)} y2="194" />
        {[-0.1, -0.05, 0, 0.05, 0.1, 0.15].map((tick) => <g><line class="tick" x1={plotX(tick)} y1="194" x2={plotX(tick)} y2="200" /><text class="tick-label" x={plotX(tick)} y="218" text-anchor="middle">{tick === 0 ? '0' : tick.toFixed(2)}</text></g>)}
        {plotRows.map((metric, index) => {
          const y = 58 + index * 52;
          const ci = metric.ci!;
          const delta = metric.delta!;
          return <g><text class="arm-label" x="22" y={y + 5}>{metric.label}</text><line class="interval" x1={plotX(ci[0])} y1={y} x2={plotX(ci[1])} y2={y} /><line class="interval-cap" x1={plotX(ci[0])} y1={y - 7} x2={plotX(ci[0])} y2={y + 7} /><line class="interval-cap" x1={plotX(ci[1])} y1={y - 7} x2={plotX(ci[1])} y2={y + 7} /><circle class="estimate" cx={plotX(delta)} cy={y} r="5" /><text class="value-label" x="742" y={y + 5} text-anchor="end">{delta >= 0 ? '+' : ''}{f.format(delta)} [{f.format(ci[0])}, {f.format(ci[1])}]</text></g>;
        })}
      </svg>
      <figcaption id="ci-caption">{t(
        'D16 的平均分为 0.201063，是四臂最高观测值；其配对差异为 +0.055646，95% CI [-0.019354, 0.131521]，p = 0.1735。最高观测均值不是已确认提升。',
        'D16 has the highest observed arm mean at 0.201063; its paired difference is +0.055646, 95% CI [-0.019354, 0.131521], p = 0.1735. The highest observed mean is not a confirmed improvement.'
      )}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="interpretation" aria-labelledby="interpretation-title">
    <p class="section-number">02</p><h2 id="interpretation-title">{t('证据解释', 'Evidence-backed interpretation')}</h2>
    <dl class="interpretation-list">
      <div><dt>{t('支持', 'Supported')}</dt><dd><ul>{claimState.confirmed[locale].map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('不支持', 'Not supported')}</dt><dd><ul><li>{t('D16 是最高观测均值，但不是已确认提升。', 'D16 is the highest observed mean, not a confirmed improvement.')}</li><li>{t('task-identity diversity 不是这组 ordered delta 的单调解释。', 'Task-identity diversity is not a monotonic explanation of these ordered deltas.')}</li><li>{t('该结果不证明 OpenEvo 或所有经验载体无效。', 'The result does not establish that OpenEvo or every experience carrier is ineffective.')}</li></ul></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('仍未知', 'Still unknown')}</dt><dd><ul>{claimState.unknown[locale].map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="next-experiment" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <p class="section-number">03</p><h2 id="next-title">{t('下一实验', 'Next experiment')}</h2>
    <p class="recommendation-label">{t('建议 / 设计移交，不是实验结果', 'Recommendation / design handoff, not an experimental result')}</p>
    <p class="section-intro">{t(
      '冻结 H1.38 D8 的同一组 16 条成功记录、8 个 task identity 与原始顺序，只改变更新方法：ordinary sequential LoRA 对比当前 SD-LoRA（sequential-difference LoRA 更新路径）。',
      'Freeze the same 16 successful H1.38 D8 records, eight task identities, and original order, changing only the update method: ordinary sequential LoRA versus the current SD-LoRA (sequential-difference LoRA update path).'
    )}</p>
    <ol class="next-steps"><li><span>1</span><div><strong>{nextDecisionNodes[0].title[locale]}</strong><p>{nextDecisionNodes[0].change[locale]}</p></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><strong>{nextDecisionNodes[1].title[locale]}</strong><p>{t('分别报告 acquisition（新学会）、retention（旧能力保留）与 untouched transfer（未见任务迁移）。', 'Report acquisition (new learning), retention (preservation of old capabilities), and untouched transfer (transfer to unseen tasks) separately.')}</p></div></li></ol>
    <p class="handoff-boundary"><strong>H1.38B.</strong> {t(
      '目前只有 goal/design handoff：没有 accepted preregistration、没有授权、没有执行、没有 sealed result。它尚未进入预注册协议，更不是已运行比较或结果。',
      'Only a goal/design handoff exists: there is no accepted preregistration, authorization, execution, or sealed result. It has not entered a preregistered protocol and is neither an executed comparison nor a result.'
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section secondary" id="methods" aria-labelledby="methods-title">
    <p class="section-number">04</p><h2 id="methods-title">{t('方法与来源', 'Methods and sources')}</h2>
    <details><summary>{t('查看有效性、冻结设计与来源', 'View validity, frozen design, and provenance')}</summary><div class="details-body">
      <dl class="method-list"><div><dt>{t('冻结设计', 'Frozen design')}</dt><dd>{t('四臂 × 48 个 task × 4 个 seeds；每个 adapter arm 固定 16 条成功记录。', 'Four arms × 48 tasks × four seeds; each adapter arm uses 16 successful records.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('训练任务来源', 'Training-task source')}</dt><dd>{t('D4/D8/D16 分别来自 4/8/16 个 task identity。', 'D4/D8/D16 draw from 4/8/16 task identities.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('推断单位', 'Inference unit')}</dt><dd>{t('相对 Base 的配对差异使用 task-cluster inference。', 'Paired differences versus Base use task-cluster inference.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('有效性', 'Validity')}</dt><dd>{t('764/768 有效；4 次 D4 parser/fallback-invalid。', '764/768 valid; four D4 parser/fallback-invalid attempts.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('快照身份', 'Snapshot identity')}</dt><dd><code>{openEvoProgramSource.branch}@{openEvoProgramSource.commit}</code><br/><code>{openEvoProgramSource.campaign}</code></dd></div></dl>
      <p>{t('实时科学状态不由此静态页面决定。请按实际实验 branch → current-campaign.json → 最新 reconciliation/result 解析。', 'This static page does not own live scientific state. Resolve it from the actual experiment branch → current-campaign.json → latest reconciliation/result.')}</p>
      <ul class="source-list"><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.report}>{t('项目总报告', 'Program report')}</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.ledger}>{t('机器可读账本', 'Machine-readable ledger')}</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.reconciliation}>H1.38A-C reconciliation</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.campaign}>current-campaign.json</a></li></ul>
    </div></details>
    <div class="print-only print-methods">
      <h3>{t('冻结设计与来源', 'Frozen design and provenance')}</h3>
      <dl class="method-list"><div><dt>{t('冻结设计', 'Frozen design')}</dt><dd>{t('四臂 × 48 个 task × 4 个 seeds；每个 adapter arm 固定 16 条成功记录。', 'Four arms × 48 tasks × four seeds; each adapter arm uses 16 successful records.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('有效性', 'Validity')}</dt><dd>{t('764/768 有效；4 次 D4 parser/fallback-invalid。', '764/768 valid; four D4 parser/fallback-invalid attempts.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('快照身份', 'Snapshot identity')}</dt><dd><code>{openEvoProgramSource.branch}@{openEvoProgramSource.commit}</code><br/><code>{openEvoProgramSource.campaign}</code></dd></div></dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section appendix" id="appendix" aria-labelledby="appendix-title">
    <p class="section-number">05</p><h2 id="appendix-title">{t('附录', 'Appendix')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('完整谱系和历史平台记录保留用于审计，默认收起，不参与主结论的视觉排序。', 'The complete lineage and historical-platform record remain available for audit, collapsed by default and outside the visual order of the main conclusion.')}</p>
    <details data-testid="lineage-appendix"><summary>{t(`附录 A：Phase G–H1.38 完整实验谱系（${programTimeline.length} 个节点）`, `Appendix A: complete Phase G–H1.38 lineage (${programTimeline.length} nodes)`)}</summary><ol class="lineage-list">
      {programTimeline.map((item) => <li><details><summary><span class="lineage-coverage">{item.coverage.join(' · ')}</span><strong>{item.title[locale]}</strong><small>{programStageLabels[item.stage][locale]} · {programResultLabels[item.result][locale]}</small></summary><div class="lineage-body"><p>{item.summary[locale]}</p><p><strong>{t('结论边界：', 'Claim boundary: ')}</strong>{item.boundary[locale]}</p><a href={item.evidence}>{t('打开冻结证据', 'Open frozen evidence')}</a></div></details></li>)}
    </ol></details>
    {hasHistoricalAppendix && <details data-testid="rtx6-appendix"><summary>{t('附录 B：RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 历史参数实验', 'Appendix B: historical RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 parametric experiments')}</summary><div class="historical-slot"><slot name="historical" /></div></details>}
    <div class="print-only print-appendices">
      <h3>{t(`附录 A：Phase G–H1.38 完整实验谱系（${programTimeline.length} 个节点）`, `Appendix A: complete Phase G–H1.38 lineage (${programTimeline.length} nodes)`)}</h3>
      <ol class="print-lineage">{programTimeline.map((item) => <li><strong>{item.coverage.join(' · ')} — {item.title[locale]}</strong><p>{item.summary[locale]}</p><p><strong>{t('结论边界：', 'Claim boundary: ')}</strong>{item.boundary[locale]}</p></li>)}</ol>
      {hasHistoricalAppendix && <div class="print-rtx6"><h3>{t('附录 B：RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 历史参数实验', 'Appendix B: historical RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 parametric experiments')}</h3><p>{t('RTX6 是已经退出当前实验主线的历史 4×RTX3090 平台；其记录仅用于方法来源与历史诊断，不改变 H1.38A-C 的主结论。', 'RTX6 is the historical 4×RTX3090 platform that is no longer on the active experiment path; its record supports method provenance and historical diagnosis only and does not change the H1.38A-C primary conclusion.')}</p></div>}
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<style>
  .paper-report{color:var(--ink);width:min(1040px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(.25rem,2vw,1rem);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.paper-header{max-width:780px;padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3rem) 0 2rem;border-top:4px solid var(--accent-deep)}
  .kicker,.section-number{margin:0 0 .65rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font:750 .7rem/1.35 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.paper-header h2,.paper-section h2{margin:0;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.025em}.paper-header h2{font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.4vw,2.8rem)}.abstract{margin:1.2rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(1.03rem,1.4vw,1.18rem);line-height:1.78}.abstract strong{font-weight:760}.implication,.section-intro{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.implication{margin:1rem 0 0;padding-left:1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-deep)}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem 1rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.paper-nav a{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;text-underline-offset:.22em}.paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--ink)}.paper-section{padding:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.paper-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.55rem,2.7vw,2.25rem)}.section-intro{margin:1rem 0 1.5rem}
  .table-region{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.table-region:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent-deep);outline-offset:3px}.table-region table{width:100%;min-width:800px;border-collapse:collapse}.table-region caption{text-align:left;padding:.85rem 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}.table-region th,.table-region td{text-align:left;padding:.78rem .65rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}.table-region thead th{background:var(--surface-muted);color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}.table-region tbody th{font-weight:760}.validity-note{max-width:820px;margin:1.2rem 0 2.2rem;padding:.85rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)}.validity-note strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .ci-figure{margin:0}.figure-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.75fr) minmax(280px,1.25fr);gap:2rem;align-items:end}.figure-heading h3{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem}.figure-heading p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55}.ci-figure svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}.axis,.tick{stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:1}.zero{stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:4 4}.interval,.interval-cap{stroke:var(--accent-deep);stroke-width:2}.estimate{fill:var(--accent-deep)}.ci-figure text{fill:var(--ink);font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.tick-label{fill:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.arm-label{font-size:14px;font-weight:750}.value-label{font-size:11px}.ci-figure figcaption{max-width:780px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.62}
  .interpretation-list{margin:1.5rem 0 0}.interpretation-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:11rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;padding:1.2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.interpretation-list dt{font-weight:780}.interpretation-list dd{margin:0}.interpretation-list ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.2rem}.interpretation-list li{margin:.45rem 0;line-height:1.62}.recommendation-label{display:inline-block;margin:1rem 0 .7rem;padding:.25rem .45rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;color:var(--muted);font:750 .68rem/1.35 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.next-steps{list-style:none;margin:1.5rem 0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.next-steps li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.next-steps>li>span{color:var(--accent-deep);font:760 .8rem/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.next-steps p{margin:.35rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.62}.handoff-boundary{max-width:820px;margin:1.4rem 0 0;padding:1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--warning);background:var(--surface-muted);line-height:1.65}
  details{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:1rem 0;font-weight:740;line-height:1.5}summary::marker{color:var(--accent-deep)}.details-body{padding:0 0 1.4rem}.method-list{margin:0}.method-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:10rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;padding:.7rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.method-list dt{font-weight:720}.method-list dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.details-body p{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.source-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.2rem;margin:1rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}.source-list a,.lineage-body a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:700;text-underline-offset:.2em}.print-only{display:none}
  .lineage-list{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}.lineage-list>li>details{padding-left:1rem}.lineage-list summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:8rem minmax(0,1fr) minmax(11rem,.55fr);gap:1rem;align-items:baseline}.lineage-coverage{color:var(--accent-deep);font:750 .7rem/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.lineage-list small{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}.lineage-body{max-width:780px;padding:0 1rem 1rem 9rem}.lineage-body p{line-height:1.62}.lineage-body p+p{color:var(--muted)}.historical-slot{padding-top:.5rem}.historical-slot :global(.history){width:100%;margin:0;padding:1rem;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent}
  @media(max-width:720px){.figure-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem}.interpretation-list>div,.method-list>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.4rem}.lineage-list summary{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.25rem}.lineage-body{padding-left:1rem}.ci-figure svg{min-width:720px}.ci-figure{overflow-x:auto}.paper-nav{gap:.35rem .8rem}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.paper-report *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
  @media print{.paper-report{width:100%;padding:0;color:#111}.paper-nav,.paper-report details{display:none!important}.paper-section{padding:1.2rem 0;break-inside:auto}.table-region{overflow:visible}.table-region table{min-width:0;font-size:9pt}.ci-figure svg{min-width:0}.print-only{display:block}.print-lineage{padding-left:1.25rem}.print-lineage li{break-inside:avoid;margin:.8rem 0}.print-lineage p,.print-rtx6 p{margin:.25rem 0;color:#333;line-height:1.45}.print-methods,.print-appendices{break-before:auto}a{color:#111;text-decoration:underline}}
</style>
